  "new_commit_message": "Point Basin and K2 skills at published docs\n\nRemove references to the pending cloudflare-docs PRs (#33850, #33858)\nnow that the Basin and K2 docs are published. This also resolves the\nSnyk W011 third-party content warning on the K2 skill.\n\n- Basin: note GA status and API deprecation per published docs, add\n  Basin pricing link, fix renamed Basin Catalog enable/disable anchors,\n  and align Basin SQL token permissions with the Query data page.\n- K2: note public beta on Workers Paid, add Delivery guarantees and\n  Pricing pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
